# ── AI-assistant scaffolding ────────────────────────────────────────
# NitroStack ships the same five SKILL.md files into one directory per
# assistant. All eight copies are byte-identical (verified by md5), so
# seven of them are 35 redundant files in every clone and every diff.
# `.claude/` is kept because CLAUDE.md is this repo's working memory.
# The files stay on disk — only git stops carrying them.
.agents/
.antigravity/
.codex/
.copilot/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.opencode/

